# ------------------------------------------------------------------ 4 activity 1 + maging verb
_N1 = [("Ito ang kauna-unahang joint training ng Philippine Army at PNP na isinagawa ng ikasiyam na raan at ikatlong Brigade.", "This is the first joint training of the Philippine Army and the PNP conducted by the 903rd Brigade."), ("Labing-anim na mga pulis mula sa PNP Sorsogon, dalawampu’t apat na sundalo mula sa ikatatlumpu’t isang Infantry Brigade na nakabase sa Rangas, Juban, at labing-apat na sundalo mula sa ikasiyam na raan at ikatlong Brigade ang isinailalim sa pagsasanay.", "Sixteen policemen from PNP Sorsogon, 24 soldiers from the 31st Infantry Brigade based in Rangas, Juban, and 14 soldiers from the 903rd Brigade were put under training."), ("Bahagi ng pagsasanay ang pagbibigay sa kanila ng refresher lecture na una na nilang pinagdaanan nang mag-umpisa silang pumasok sa ganitong propesyon tulad ng General Information Module, Military Courtesy and Discipline, Bayanihan Best Practices, Individual Skills Development Module, Small Unit Leadership, Troop Leading Procedure, Map Reading at Land Navigation.", "Part of the training is giving them a refresher lecture that they first went through when they started entering this profession, such as the General Information Module, Military Courtesy and Discipline, Bayanihan Best Practices, Individual Skills Development Module, Small Unit Leadership, Troop Leading Procedure, Map Reading and Land Navigation."), ("Sasailalim din sila sa Squad Tactics, Immediate Action Drill at iba pang Field Training Exercises para mas mapalalim pa ang kanilang kakayahan bilang mga sundalo, lalo na pagdating sa mga combat operation.", "They will also undergo Squad Tactics, Immediate Action Drill and other Field Training Exercises to deepen their ability as soldiers, especially when it comes to combat operations."), ("Magtatagal ng isang buwan ang Small Unit Operation Training ng mga ito kung saan magiging taga-pagsanay nila dito ang mga batikang instructors ng Scout Rangers at Special Forces mula sa Battalion at ikasiyam na raan at ikatlong Brigade.", "Their Small Unit Operation Training will last a month, where the seasoned instructors of the Scout Rangers and Special Forces from the Battalion and the 903rd Brigade will be their trainers.")]
